    "Ziyarat by Shaykh al-Mufid\nPerform ghusl for the ziyarat and go to the shrine. Ask permission at its door ([Izn-e-Dukhool](B6)), then enter saying:\nبِسْمِ اللّٰهِ وَبِاللّٰهِ\nBISMILLAAHI WA BILLAAH\nIn the Name of Allah (I begin), in Allah (I trust),\nوَفِيْ سَبِيْلِ اللّٰهِ\nWA FEE SABEELILLAAH\non the way of Allah (I proceed),\nوَعَلٰى مِلَّةِ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ صَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِ وَاٰلِهٖ\nWA A'LAA MILLATI RASOOLILLAAHI SALLALLAAHU A'LAYHI WA AALIH\nand on the norm of the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and his Household,\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلٰىۤ اَوْلِيَاۤءِ اللّٰهِ\nWAS SALAAMU A'LAA AWLIYAA'ILLAAH\nand peace be upon the intimate servants of Allah.\nThen stand before the grave of Imam Musa ibn Ja'far (a.s.) and say:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُوْرَ اللّٰهِ فِيْ ظُلُمَاتِ الْاَرْضِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA NOORALLAAHI FEE ZULUMAATIL ARD\nPeace be upon you, O light of Allah in the darkness of the earth.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA WALIYYALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s intimate servant.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA HUJJATALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s argument.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بَابَ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YAA BAABALLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O door to Allah.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلَاةَ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA AQAMTAS SALAAH\nI bear witness that you performed the prayers,\nوَاٰتَيْتَ الزَّكَاةَ\nWA AATAYTAZ ZAKAAH\ndefrayed the poor-rate,\nوَاَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ\nWA AMARTA BIL MA'ROOF\nenjoined the right,\nوَنَهَيْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ\nWA NAHAYTA A'NIL MUNKAR\nforbade the wrong,\nوَتَلَوْتَ الْكِتَابَ حَقَّ تِلَاوَتِهٖ\nWA TALAWTAL KITAABA HAQQA TILAAWATIH\nrecited the Book as it should be recited,\nوَجَاهَدْتَ فِي اللّٰهِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهٖ\nWA JAAHADTA FILLAAHI HAQQA JIHAADIH\nstrove in the way of Allah as it ought to be striven,\nوَصَبَرْتَ عَلَى الْاَذٰى فِيْ جَنْبِهٖ مُحْتَسِبًا\nWA SABARTA A'LAL ADHAA FEE JANBIHEE MUHTASIBAA\nendured harm for His sake, expecting His reward,\nوَعَبَدْتَهٗ مُخْلِصًا حَتّٰىۤ اَتَاكَ الْيَقِيْنُ\nWA A'BADTAHOO MUKHLISAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEEN\nand served Him sincerely until death came upon you.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اَوْلٰى بِاللّٰهِ وَبِرَسُوْلِهٖ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA AWLAA BILLAAHI WA BIRASOOLIH\nI bear witness that you are the closest to Allah and His Messenger\nوَاَنَّكَ ابْنُ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ حَقًّا\nWA ANNAKABNU RASOOLILLAAHI HAQQAA\nand that you are truly the son of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَبْرَاُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ مِنْ اَعْدَاۤئِكَ\nABRA'U ILALLAAHI MIN A'DAA'IK\nI repudiate your enemies in the presence of Allah\nوَاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَى اللّٰهِ بِمُوَالَاتِكَ\nWA ATAQARRABU ILALLAAHI BIMUWAALAATIK\nand seek nearness to Allah through my loyalty to you.\nاَتَيْتُكَ يَا مَوْلَايَ عَارِفًا بِحَقِّكَ\nATAYTUKA YAA MAWLAAYA A'ARIFAN BIHAQQIK\nI have come to you, O my master, recognizing your right,\nمُوَالِيًا لِاَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ\nMUWAALIYAN LI-AWLIYAA'IK\ndeclaring loyalty to your loyalists,\nمُعَادِيًا لِاَعْدَاۤئِكَ\nMU'AADIYAN LI-A'DAA'IK\nand incurring the animosity of your enemies;\nفَاشْفَعْ لِيْ عِنْدَ رَبِّكَ\nFASHFA' LEE I'NDA RABBIK\nso, (please) intercede for me with your Lord.\nThen lean over the grave, kiss it and lay both cheeks on it. Then go to the side of his head and say:\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ\nAS-SALAAMU A'LAYKA YABNA RASOOLILLAAH\nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ صَادِقٌ\nASH-HADU ANNAKA SAADIQ\nI bear witness that you are truthful.\nاَدَّيْتَ نَاصِحًا\nADDAYTA NAASIHAA\nYou fulfilled [your duty] sincerely,\nوَقُلْتَ اَمِيْنًا\nWA QULTA AMEENAA\nspoke honestly,\nوَمَضَيْتَ شَهِيْدًا\nWA MADAYTA SHAHEEDAA\nand passed away as a martyr.\nلَمْ تُؤْثِرْ عَمًى عَلَى الْهُدٰى\nLAM TU'THIR A'MAN A'LAL HUDAA\nYou never preferred blindness to the true guidance\nوَلَمْ تَمِلْ مِنْ حَقٍّ اِلٰى بَاطِلٍ\nWA LAM TAMIL MIN HAQQIN ILAA BAATIL\nand never slanted from right to wrong.\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْكَ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYK\nMay Allah send blessings upon you,\nوَعَلٰىۤ اٰبَاۤئِكَ وَاَبْنَاۤئِكَ الطَّاهِرِيْنَ\nWA A'LAA AABAA'IKA WA ABNAA'IKAT TAAHIREEN\nupon your fathers, and upon your sons the immaculate.\nThen kiss the grave and pray the two-unit prayer of the ziyarat, and any other prayers you wish. Then prostrate and say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِلَيْكَ اعْتَمَدْتُ\nALLAAHUMMA ILAYKA' TAMADT\nO Allah, I have had recourse to You,\nوَاِلَيْكَ قَصَدْتُ\nWA ILAYKA QASADT\nmade my way to You,\nوَبِفَضْلِكَ رَجَوْتُ\nWA BIFADLIKA RAJAWT\nhoped for Your favoring,\nوَقَبْرَ اِمَامِيَ الَّذِيْ اَوْجَبْتَ عَلَيَّ طَاعَتَهٗ زُرْتُ\nWA QABRA IMAAMIYAL LADHEE AWJABTA A'LAYYA TAA'ATAHOO ZURT\nand visited the tomb of my Imam, obedience to whom You have made obligatory on me,\nوَبِهٖ اِلَيْكَ تَوَسَّلْتُ\nWA BIHEE ILAYKA TAWASSALT\nand I have taken him as my means to You;\nفَبِحَقِّهِمُ الَّذِيۤ اَوْجَبْتَ عَلٰى نَفْسِكَ\nFABIHAQQIHIMUL LADHEE AWJABTA A'LAA NAFSIK\nso, [I beseech You] in the name of their rights which You have made incumbent upon Yourself,\nاغْفِرْ لِيْ وَلِوَالِدَيَّ وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ يَا كَرِيْمُ\nIGHFIR LEE WA LIWAALIDAYYA WA LILMU'MINEENA YAA KAREEM\nforgive me, my parents, and the believers, O All-generous.\nThen lay your right cheek on the ground and say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ قَدْ عَلِمْتَ حَوَاۤئِجِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA QAD A'LIMTA HAWAA'IJEE\nO Allah, You already know my needs;\nفَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاقْضِهَا\nFASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WAQDIHAA\nso, bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad and fulfil them for me.\nThen lay your left cheek on the ground and say:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ قَدْ اَحْصَيْتَ ذُنُوْبِيْ\nALLAAHUMMA QAD AHSAYTA DHUNOOBEE\nO Allah, You have certainly taken account of my sins;\nفَبِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nFABIHAQQI MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nso, [I beseech You] in the name of Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMAD\nsend blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاغْفِرْهَا وَتَصَدَّقْ عَلَيَّ بِمَا اَنْتَ اَهْلُهٗ\nWAGHFIRHAA WA TASADDAQ A'LAYYA BIMAA ANTA AHLUH\nforgive them, and grant me as charity that which suits You.\nThen return to prostration and say 100 times:\nشُكْرًا\nSHUKRAN\nThanks.\nThen raise your head and pray for whatever you wish, and for whomever you wish."
  ],
  "merits": "Ziyarat by Sayyid Ibn Tawus: Ibn Tawus gives it in his al-Mazar as the ziyarat specific to Imam Musa al-Kazim (a.s.).\n\nZiyarat by Shaykh al-Mufid: also given by al-Shahid and Muhammad ibn al-Mashhadi, for visiting the Imam in Baghdad."
